  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iQlGHUt.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZapGEPqm2V\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1173075408556654592?style=flat-square&logo=discord&logoColor=orange&label= &labelColor=white&color=gray\" alt=\"\" width=\"79\" height=\"20\"></a><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong>關於</strong></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p>\n<pre><strong>CoolCatLib 是所有我開發的模組運作所需的核心函式庫，讓我在開發模組時變得非常輕鬆。</strong><br><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:10px\"><em><strong>注意：此模組是專為滿足我的個人需求而設計，並非供其他開發者直接使用。</strong></em></span><br><span style=\"color:#800000\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:10px\">不過，歡迎大家自由參考並改編其中的實作方式以符合自身需求。</span><br><br></strong></em></span></pre>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><strong><span style=\"color:#808080\">⟪</span> <em>功能特色</em> <span style=\"color:#808080\">⟫</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#333\"><strong>適用於 Fabric 的釀造配方註冊表</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#333\"><strong><strong>一系列輔助類別</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#333\"><strong><strong>以及更多...</strong></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong>翻譯</strong></em></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>歡迎前往專案的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fcoolcatlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin 連結！</a> 協助翻譯。</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>支援語言：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#808080\"><em><strong>英語</strong></em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#808080\"><em><strong>阿拉伯語</strong></em></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p>",
